{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlxrl7sekvc0","created":1791290788330,"text":"线性模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxrnph5eeg0","created":1791290983560,"text":"基本形式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxrnptbbhc0","created":1791290984296,"text":"通用形式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxromretps0","created":1791291056014,"text":"f(x)=(wT)x+b,w为权重向量，b为偏置。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxroii789c0","created":1791291046750,"text":"优点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxroo4qy2o0","created":1791291058998,"text":"形式简单、可解释性强；很多非线性模型可由线性模型引入层级或者高维映射得到。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxrnrrfo9s0","created":1791290988536,"text":"线性回归"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxry7myn8g0","created":1791291806735,"text":"单变量线性回归"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxt8kq4qmw0","created":1791295439977,"text":"目的"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxt98375ww0","created":1791295490833,"text":"构建F(xi)函数，使得f(xi)等价于真实标记yi"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxt8o29nnk0","created":1791295447241,"text":"损失"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxtadbe75k0","created":1791295580576,"text":"均方误差，使用最小二乘法，求导置零，得到w,b闭式解析解"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlxtb3gv36o0","created":1791295637503,"text":"最小二乘法就是试图找到条直线，使所有样本到直线上的欧氏距离之和最小"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxry8gzqbs0","created":1791291808551,"text":"多元线性回归"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxtcquwfds0","created":1791295766782,"text":"将b并入权重，构建增广矩阵和样本矩阵"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlxtesb8yaw0","created":1791295926676,"text":"注意"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxteyyl20w0","created":1791295941148,"text":"若矩阵X不满秩(特征数>样本数)，有多组最优解，由归纳偏好选择，一般引入正则化。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxry99k5ug0","created":1791291810279,"text":"广义线性模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxtgeme8800","created":1791296053603,"text":"形式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxth4rgxgo0","created":1791296110507,"text":"g(y)=(wT)x+b，g(.)称为联系函数"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxtgfm5aw00","created":1791296055765,"text":"对数线性回归"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxth0hquw00","created":1791296101211,"text":"本质把线性输出映射为非线性。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxrnsppkhs0","created":1791290990608,"text":"对数几率回归"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxryqzy0nc0","created":1791291848879,"text":"含义"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlxt819q5k80","created":1791295397626,"text":"名字叫回归，实际是一种分类学习算法"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxryrogfvc0","created":1791291850361,"text":"单位阶跃函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlxtk54va0g0","created":1791296346409,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlxtk68ymi80","created":1791296348834,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlxrntfwpq80","created":1791290992192,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlxrnu6i79s0","created":1791290993800,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlxro09gxhk0","created":1791291007040,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}